OL,3,GNEWSAPermission granted for first phase
OL,4,Aof film studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first phase of a city's new film
OL,7,Fstudio has been granted planning
OL,8,Fpermission.
OL,10,FStudio One at Crown Works in Sunderland
OL,11,Fwill have three sound stages,
OL,12,Fproduction accommodation, backlot space
OL,13,Fand a car park.
OL,15,FThe WH Foster Printworks building will
OL,16,Falso be refurbished as part of the
OL,17,Fplans, which were given the go-ahead by
OL,18,Fthe city council's planning authority
OL,19,Fthis week.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
